1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:01,700
Please! Wait, ma'am!

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:03,067
- Don't fire me immediately!
- Throw her to the ground!

3
00:00:03,067 --> 00:00:05,433
[GROANS, PANTING] Ma'am!

4
00:00:05,433 --> 00:00:08,333
Where's the due process, ma'am?

5
00:00:08,333 --> 00:00:09,567
Shut up!

6
00:00:10,033 --> 00:00:12,700
Go to the Supreme Court
if you want due process!

7
00:00:13,200 --> 00:00:15,233
You dare claim
that you're the inheritor

8
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:16,667
of this hotel?

9
00:00:16,667 --> 00:00:19,500
- Ma'am!
- [SCREAMING HYSTERICALLY]

10
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,000
[SCREAMING] The audacity!

11
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:25,700
[GRUNTS]

12
00:00:27,633 --> 00:00:34,567
[SOBBING, SNIFFLING]

13
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:37,267
Where did it go?

14
00:00:37,267 --> 00:00:44,200
[SOMBER MUSIC PLAYING]

15
00:00:46,633 --> 00:00:48,100
Mom...

16
00:00:54,233 --> 00:01:01,200
[SOBBING, SNIFFLING CONTINUES]

17
00:01:05,767 --> 00:01:08,167
How could they be
so cruel to me?

18
00:01:13,667 --> 00:01:15,133
[CAR DOOR OPENS]

19
00:01:17,267 --> 00:01:18,467
[CAR DOOR CLOSES]

20
00:01:20,233 --> 00:01:21,433
What happened?

21
00:01:22,667 --> 00:01:25,667
You! Why did you have
to come into my life?!

22
00:01:25,667 --> 00:01:27,667
I lost my job!

23
00:01:29,167 --> 00:01:31,400
I never should have left you
alone with them.

24
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:33,167
No! You're bad luck!

25
00:01:33,433 --> 00:01:35,300
Go back to your girlfriend!

26
00:01:35,300 --> 00:01:39,300
[SOMBER MUSIC CONTINUES]

27
00:01:39,300 --> 00:01:40,533
She's not my...

28
00:01:44,833 --> 00:01:49,133
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC PLAYING]

29
00:01:49,133 --> 00:01:50,267
Your necklace.

30
00:01:51,533 --> 00:01:54,333
My father gave it to my mother
as a gift.

31
00:01:58,800 --> 00:02:00,567
I'll return it as soon as I can.

32
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:02,167
Huh?

33
00:02:02,167 --> 00:02:03,167
[THUDS]

34
00:02:03,167 --> 00:02:04,433
That's mine!

35
00:02:05,200 --> 00:02:06,600
- [DOOR CLOSES]
- Hey!

36
00:02:06,600 --> 00:02:07,567
It's mine!

37
00:02:08,167 --> 00:02:09,333
Hey!

38
00:02:09,333 --> 00:02:10,667
She's not your mother!

39
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,200
Mother stealer!

40
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:15,167
[SIGHS]

41
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:22,233
[SOBBING, SNIFFLING]

42
00:02:22,233 --> 00:02:29,100
[MELANCHOLIC MUSIC CONTINUES]
